        "description": "Creates a new on-chain transfer. Returns unsigned payloads for the client to sign before executing.\n\nFor CeFi transfers, `network` is required — retrieve the supported values from `GET /assets` (see the `network` field below). Omit it for DeFi transfers, which derive the network from the asset's chain.",
